```bash
cd laravel && ./vendor/bin/phpstan analyse Modules --memory-limit=-1
# [OK] No errors  (2026-09-24 ~15:50, 8085 file)
```

Precedente scope ristretto (ancora valido):

```bash
cd laravel && php -d memory_limit=2G ./vendor/bin/phpstan analyse \
  Modules/Geo/app Modules/Geo/config Modules/Geo/database --no-progress
# [OK] No errors
